  "tempo": 1.12,
  "segments": [
    {
      "text": "Those bumpy tiles at the edge of a train",
      "start": 0.088,
      "end": 1.732
    },
    {
      "text": "platform are a language,",
      "start": 1.787,
      "end": 2.786
    },
    {
      "text": "and it only has two words.",
      "start": 2.989,
      "end": 4.114
    },
    {
      "text": "Round domes mean stop,",
      "start": 4.43,
      "end": 5.912
    },
    {
      "text": "because there is an edge,",
      "start": 6.178,
      "end": 7.106
    },
    {
      "text": "a road,",
      "start": 7.396,
      "end": 7.896
    },
    {
      "text": "or a drop ahead.",
      "start": 8.051,
      "end": 8.82
    },
    {
      "text": "Long parallel bars mean keep going,",
      "start": 9.186,
      "end": 11.152
    },
    {
      "text": "this way is safe.",
      "start": 11.33,
      "end": 12.063
    },
    {
      "text": "Both are readable through a shoe",
      "start": 12.391,
      "end": 13.695
    },
    {
      "text": "or the tip of a cane,",
      "start": 13.965,
      "end": 14.859
    },
    {
      "text": "and the yellow helps if you still have some",
      "start": 15.071,
      "end": 16.519
    },
    {
      "text": "sight.",
      "start": 16.626,
      "end": 16.959
    },
    {
      "text": "An engineer in Japan named",
      "start": 17.112,
      "end": 18.416
    },
    {
      "text": "Seiichi Miyake",
      "start": 18.72,
      "end": 19.63
    },
    {
      "text": "paid for the first ones himself in 1965,",
      "start": 19.872,
      "end": 22.212
    },
    {
      "text": "because a friend was going blind.",
      "start": 22.435,
      "end": 23.74
    },
    {
      "text": "They are under most of the world's feet now.",
      "start": 24.051,
      "end": 25.586
    }
  ],
